Now styles.css. Big but manageable. Need ensure mobile. Let's write carefully.

Fonts: no external. Use `font-family: "Trebuchet MS", "Segoe UI", system-ui, sans-serif;` for body. Display: `"Arial Black", "Trebuchet MS", sans-serif`. Monospace for stats.

Background:
```css
html,body {height:100%; margin:0}
body {
 background:
 radial-gradient(ellipse at 72% 16%, rgba(255,244,197,.55), transparent 46%),
 radial-gradient(ellipse at 30% 80%, rgba(118,196,170,.18), transparent 55%),
 linear-gradient(180deg,#3d8bc9 0%,#74bfe4 38%,#b9e4f4 68%,#ffe6ba 100%);
 overflow:hidden;
 color:var(--cream);
 ...
}
```
Maybe a sunset warmer. Good.
Canvas fixed; touch-action none; cursor grab.
Vignette radial at center transparent to rgba(5,18,24,.22) edges and bottom.

Panels:
```css
.panel { background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(12,31,38,.72), rgba(7,20,26,.62)); border:1px solid rgba(191,240,255,.14); box-shadow: 0 18px 45px rgba(2,12,18,.22), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.07); backdrop-filter: blur(12px) saturate(120%); border-radius:14px; }
```
Topbar brand.
Brand mark grid 2x2 with one green.
Stats chips.
Icon button.

Hero:
- `h1` with huge letter spacing and block shadow. `title-a` cream; `title-b` green with text-shadow. Add `-webkit-text-stroke: 1px rgba(10,24,26,.25)`? Maybe not.
- tagline.
- button blocky:
```css
.btn.primary { background: linear-gradient(180deg,#97ef7e,#64cf58); color:#0a2417; border:1px solid #b4ff9f; box-shadow: 0 5px 0 #2f7a3d, 0 12px 24px rgba(10,40,20,.3), inset 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.7); }
.btn.primary:active { transform: translateY(4px); box-shadow: 0 1px 0 ...}
```
- `hero-stamp` fixed bottom right with blueprint card, only desktop; may overlap scene? It's decorative overlay right; fine. Hidden mobile.

Hero layout gradient:
```css
.hero-overlay { background: linear-gradient(100deg, rgba(3,13,18,.9) 0%, rgba(3,13,18,.66) 34%, rgba(3,13,18,.1) 64%, transparent 80%); }
```
- The hero copy width 540.
- `pointer-events:none` overlay; `.hero-copy,.hero-stamp` pointer auto.

Hero tetromino art:
- 4 blocks in T shape using grid 3x2, positions 2/1,1/2,2/2,3/2. Colors gradient? Use piece colors: t1 purple top, t2 cyan, t3 green, t4 gold. 18px blocks with 3px gap and bevel; width ~66.
- Add small rotation.

Feature row chips with dashed borders.

Toast:
```css
.toast{position:fixed;left:50%;top:16%;transform:translate(-50%,10px) scale(.96);opacity:0;...}
.toast.show{opacity:1;transform:translate(-50%,0) scale(1)}
.toast b{display:block;font:900 clamp(24px,4vw,44px)/1 display; letter-spacing:.06em; text-shadow:...}
.toast span{...}
```
- color accent based on class maybe.

HUD:
- `.game-live` toggles.
- Use `body.game-live` selectors.
- `#left-hud` top 92 left 22; z 12.
- `.panel-label` 10px letter spacing.
- `.mini-list` flex column gap 6.
- `.mini` 62x50; background rgba; border; display flex center.
- `.mini-grid` grid; width auto. Need JS sets width/height based on cells. We'll set style `gridTemplateColumns` and `gridTemplateRows`, and `.mini-grid{display:grid;gap:2px}`; each cell 9px? Use `grid-auto-columns: 9px; grid-auto-rows: 9px`. JS creates cells with width. Let's define `.mini-grid { display:grid; gap:2px; } .mini-cell{width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:2px}`. For 4-wide = 42px, fits 62.
- Hold panel maybe opacity .8.

House:
- width 250.
- pips grid 12.
- `.pip` height 8, background rgba(167,237,255,.15), border radius 2; `.pip.on` background linear-gradient green; box-shadow; `.pip.now` animation pulse.
- meta.
- house label.

Topbar responsive.
- On desktop, stats center? `topbar` display grid columns 1fr auto 1fr? brand left, stats center, actions right. Use flex with stats margin-left auto and actions; but center? Use `justify-content:space-between`; stats center-ish. Fine.
- Brand tag small hidden <1100.

Controls hint bottom center 18; glass; kbd.
- Touch hidden.

Mobile media:
```css
@media (max-width: 820px), (hover: none) and (max-width: 1100px) { ... }
```
Be careful media with hover none could show touch on laptops? Use max-width 820 only; touch controls for tablets bigger? Add `@media (pointer: coarse) and (max-width: 1100px)`. CSS can have separate media for touch layout. Simpler max-width 900.
