 .house-top{display:flex; gap:8px; align-items:baseline; grid-column:1}
 .house-label{display:none}
 #house-percent{font-size:16px}
 .pips{grid-column:2; gap:2px}
 .house-meta{grid-column:3; flex-direction:column; align-items:flex-end; gap:0; font-size:8px}
 .house-tip{display:none}
 #controls-hint{display:none}
 #touch{display:flex}
 ...
}
```
- Need house-stage and lines readable: house-meta spans; on mobile show only lines? Use CSS hide stage? Maybe show stage under percent. Could hide `#house-stage`? Keep both but tiny. `house-lines` maybe 8px. Fine.
- Topbar and house-hud overlap? house-hud top 62, topbar height ~54. good. Height 40 -> ends 102. left-hud top 112. House scene top ~122; next row ends 112+~45=157, over house lower-left? House spans full width; panel overlays tree area. Okay.
- Board top ~310; no overlap.
- Touch:
```css
#touch { display:none; position:fixed; left:0; right:0; bottom:calc(12px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom)); padding: 0 16px; justify-content:space-between; align-items:flex-end; z-index:25; pointer-events:none; }
.touch-pad { display:grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 54px); grid-template-rows: 54px 54px; gap:7px; pointer-events:auto; }
...
```
Positions: left button col1 row1; rotate col2 row1; right col3 row1; hold col1 row2; down col2 row2. Grid auto placement with order: left (1,1), rotate (2,1), right (3,1), hold (1,2), down (2,2). Good.
- Drop big right 86x86 round.
- Buttons background glass with border; font.
- `.touch-btn:active,.touch-btn.pressed` transform scale .92, background green-ish.
- `touch-action:none; user-select:none`.
- Hide on body not game-live: `opacity:0; pointer-events:none`. `body.game-live #touch{opacity:1; pointer-events:none}` but buttons auto.
- `#touch` itself pointer-events none; children auto.

- On mobile, hide hero-stamp; hero overlay full dark; h1 18vw; tagline; features maybe hidden; hero keys replaced with `.touch-note`? Add text "Tap, swipe, drop." Could just hide hero-keys and show feature row. Fine.
- Start button full width? width auto 220.
